WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.902
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.570
How is everybody doin' tonight?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:06.239
-Great to hear.

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:08.374
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:11.844 line:0%
Former President George W. Bush
spoke about Russia last night

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:15.448 line:0%
at an event in Dallas
and had quite the Freudian slip.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.017 line:0%
-The decision of one man

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:23.489 line:0%
to launch a wholly unjustified
and brutal invasion of Iraq --

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:25.658 line:0%
I mean, of Ukraine.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.060
-Oof!

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.464
That's like your wife
asking if you're hungry

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:34.267
and saying, "I could cheat.
I mean, eat!"

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.535
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.937
"I could eat with my mistress.
Aghh!"

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.305
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.407
President Biden yesterday
launched a program

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:43.609
that activates military aircraft

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:45.979
to import baby formula
from abroad.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.781
Said the French, "White or red?"

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:54.253
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.253 --> 00:00:57.223
Health Secretary Xavier Becerra
tested positive yesterday

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.926
for the coronavirus.
Wow, the health secretary.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.761
That's embarrassing.
That's like finding out

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.330
the transportation secretary
got hit by a train.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.333
[ Laughter ]
He's fine. He's fine.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.637
President Biden yesterday
formally endorsed

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:13.605
Finland and Sweden's application
to join NATO.

00:01:13.605 --> 00:01:15.875
Though if it's anything
like his past endorsements,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.311
it probably hurt
more than it helped.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.379
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.582
According to a new report,
the Secret Service

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.118
is currently providing
protection for 33 people

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.853
in the Biden administration
or family,

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.321
as opposed to to Trump,

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.957
where his administration
was his family.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.692
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.795
Elon Musk tweeted yesterday,
"Political attacks on me

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.863
will escalate dramatically
in coming months."

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:39.899
And based on
his previous predictions,

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.101
this can only mean
that political attacks on him

00:01:42.101 --> 00:01:45.237
will stop completely.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:47.974
Health officials
in Massachusetts

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.875
announced yesterday
that they have identified

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:52.611
the first case of monkeypox
in the country.

00:01:52.611 --> 00:01:55.081
But don't worry,
it can be easily cured

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:58.518
with, uh -- aw, baby formula!
Damn it!

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:01.420
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.624
Son of a bitch!

00:02:07.226 --> 00:02:10.096
The 75th Cannes Film Festival
began this week

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.764
and included
a live video message

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:14.366
from Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy.

00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:16.202
But this is weird.
It was just,

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.738
"Please don't text
during the movie."

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.674
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:24.177
A 2-year-old boy in Texas
recently ordered

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:25.811
31 cheeseburgers from McDonald's

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:27.714
through the delivery app
DoorDash

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.114
while playing
with his mom's phone.

00:02:29.114 --> 00:02:32.418
To be fair, in Texas,
That's just one button.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:35.788
[ Cheers and laughter ]

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.858
And finally,
the makers of Hot Pockets

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:41.627
have unveiled a new line of
cheese and cold cut sandwiches

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:44.664
called Deliwiches
that can be eaten hot or cold,

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:48.034
as opposed to Hot Pockets,
which are always a mix of both.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:50.770
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

